From 496713577ce1d366fb58533b2cd66610c90b299b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: c <c@l>
Date: Mon, 25 May 2026 08:27:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Dashboard fix-stage chat: diagnose + auto-fix failed builds

Adds an operator-driven panel on /builds error+building rows that calls
the pipeline worker's /fix-stage to diagnose a failed stage and apply the
proposed fix with confirm. Companion to the /custom-prompt edit flow.

- src/app/api/builds/fix-stage/route.ts  admin-only proxy, forwards
  x-pipeline-secret server-side, pins latest jobId
- src/components/FixStageButton.tsx       diagnose -> proposed fixes ->
  confirm, with evidence + post-fix Verify readout
- SitesTable wiring + it/en i18n keys

Worker /fix-stage endpoint is the andreabbo/elite-pipeline-workflow side
(separate patch). Spec: docs/dashboard-fix-stage-chat.md (meta-repo).
---
